          objective: 'Collect cards of one suit totalling 31 points or a special hand; avoid having the lowest score to avoid receiving sticks; three sticks mean elimination; last player left wins.',
          gameplay: "1. Play a card to the center. 2. Add its value to running total. 3. Draw a replacement card. 4. If total > 31, earn a 'palka' (stick). Total resets. 5. Three sticks = out.",
